            "value" : "This card costs 5 diamonds. Your 3 permanent diamonds cover part of the cost, so you only spend the 2 diamond tokens in your hand. Buy it now."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张卡需要 5 个钻石。你的 3 个永久钻石会抵扣费用，所以只需支付手中的 2 个钻石筹码。现在购买它。"
          }
